		/// <summary>Adds a new filter object to the system.</summary>
		/// <param name="engineHandle">
		/// <para>Type: **HANDLE** Handle for an open session to the filter engine. Call  [FwpmEngineOpen0](nf-fwpmu-fwpmengineopen0.md) to open a session to the filter engine.</para>
